### Todo API - REST Client file (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ)
### Base URL
@base = http://localhost:3001

### Health
GET {{base}}/api/health

### List all todos
GET {{base}}/api/todos

### List with filters
GET {{base}}/api/todos?completed=false&priority=high&search=react&sortBy=dueDate&order=asc

### Stats
GET {{base}}/api/todos/stats

### Get one (replace ID)
GET {{base}}/api/todos/{{id}}

### Create
POST {{base}}/api/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "New task from REST client",
  "description": "Testing create endpoint",
  "priority": "high",
  "tags": ["test", "api"]
}

### Update (replace ID)
PUT {{base}}/api/todos/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated title",
  "completed": true,
  "priority": "medium"
}

### Toggle
PATCH {{base}}/api/todos/{{id}}/toggle

### Delete
DELETE {{base}}/api/todos/{{id}}
